# Local session-handoff notes: handoff plans, session prompts, cleanup plans.
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. The dev/ release strip only keeps them off main — the dev
# branch is public too, so a handoff written under dev/ is world-readable. Both the
# handoff-plan skill paths are listed: handoffs/ (its documented home) and
# dev/handoff/ (where a past session wrote them). Never commit either.
handoffs/
dev/handoff/

# Claude Code local state (per-machine permission grants, worktrees — never commit)
